# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
# No key is needed for rungs 1, 2, 2.5 or 2.6 -- every one of them runs locally
# at $0.00. Rung 3 is the first thing in this project that spends money.

# Rung 3, the LLM reranker. https://openrouter.ai/keys
# ADR-0008 pins two models, both open weights, both by exact snapshot rather
# than a `-latest` alias -- a moving alias would silently change what a
# RESULTS.md entry means, which is the failure ADR-0006 pins the dataset
# revision to prevent.
#   openai/gpt-oss-120b   $0.037 / $0.17 per 1M   ctx 131,072
#   minimax/minimax-m3    $0.30  / $1.20 per 1M   ctx 1,048,576
# They are 8x apart on price on purpose: a pair closer than this project's
# +/-6pp interval could not have produced a readable comparison.
# Four runs -- each model at its least and most reasoning -- come to ~$1.62.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. Only silences a rate-limit warning when the rung-2 encoder or the
# rung-2.6 cross-encoder downloads weights from the Hugging Face Hub; both work
# without it, and neither needs an account. https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=
